From: Aitor Camacho <aitor@lunarg.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:54:25 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] kk: Fix input attachment descriptor assert

Reviewed-by: squidbus <squidbus@proton.me>
Signed-off-by: Aitor Camacho <aitor@lunarg.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45325>
(cherry picked from commit 1d396c4031a8062fb1fb9a63600b5fa38f19b6d6)
---
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_descriptor_set.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_descriptor_set.c b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_descriptor_set.c
index 1e28c40c5d1..c7407e09d94 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_descriptor_set.c
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_descriptor_set.c
@@ -71,7 +71,7 @@ get_sampled_image_view_desc(VkDescriptorType descriptor_type,
       plane_count = view->plane_count;
       for (uint8_t plane = 0; plane < plane_count; plane++) {
          if (is_input_attachment) {
-            assert(view->planes[plane].sampled_gpu_resource_id);
+            assert(view->planes[plane].input_gpu_resource_id);
             desc[plane].image_gpu_resource_id =
                view->planes[plane].input_gpu_resource_id;
             desc[plane].residency_gpu_resource_id =
